    "created_at": "2021-04-28T17:49:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-28T17:49:52Z",
    "body": "@domenic the problem is that the standard gives preference to latin characters in debugging and inspection workflows. And while the reasons for this traditionally on the web make sense, extending this to modules both inside and outside of the browser makes it worth considering if there are alternatives. Effectively `decodeURI` + not decoding `%25` itself would be the suggestion.",
