    "created_at": "2021-04-28T18:04:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-28T18:04:18Z",
    "body": "The concern seems valid in the abstract, but it would be good to see what \"userland\" has done around this as the problem is not new and it's rather unclear what a solution would look like. Note that `decodeURI()` cannot handle all URLs, e.g., `https://example.com/%80` throws.\r\n\r\nAlso, perhaps we can take a step back and go through https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features? It would be useful to know what the problematic scenarios are with some more precision. There might be alternative solutions that preserve the readability you are looking for without changing the representation of this particular field.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
